        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-chiral-seed-pod-opening-audit-v3-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-chiral-seed-pod-opening-audit-v3-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-10>,
