    pk:hypothesisType "Non-Euclidean Incompatible Shell Elasticity, Gauss Incompatibility (det b_0 = -κ_0^2 < 0) & Föppl–von Kármán Helicoid-to-Helical-Ribbon Pitchfork Bifurcation" ;
