<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-freund-dynamic-crack-speed-law-v-c-r-1-gamma-c-g-across-the-7-point-suture-toughness-sweep-homogeneous-suture-fully-dried> a schema:PropertyValue,
