<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-griffith-initiation-time-t-c-of-suture-dehiscence-on-the-desiccation-curve-kappa-0-t-kappa-0-f-1-exp-t-tau-dry> a schema:PropertyValue,
